# Docker runtime for agtsmith

On this dev box the **:8787 sidecar must run in Docker**, not via `make ui-dev`.

After editing matched files:

1. Read and follow [.cursor/skills/agtsmith-docker-build/SKILL.md](../skills/agtsmith-docker-build/SKILL.md)
2. Run `.cursor/skills/agtsmith-docker-build/scripts/deploy.sh`
3. Do not claim UI/MCP fixes are verified until deploy completes and labels match current source

Host `.venv` + `make check` is for unit tests only; live investigation validation uses the container.
